---
source: crates/core/tests/arch.rs
expression: recommended_plan(&sys)
---
Bootcraft plan for Arch Linux (12 tasks)

[1/12] Colorful pacman output  (arch.pacman-tweaks)
    $ edit /etc/pacman.conf: enable Color in [options]
    $ edit /etc/pacman.conf: enable ILoveCandy in [options]

[2/12] Enable the multilib repository  (arch.multilib)
    $ edit /etc/pacman.conf: enable the [multilib] repository

[3/12] Update the system  (system.update)
    $ pacman -Syu --noconfirm

[4/12] Build tools (base-devel, git)  (arch.build-tools)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm base-devel git

[5/12] NVIDIA 580 legacy driver (AUR)  (gpu.nvidia)
    $ pacman -Rns --noconfirm nvidia-open nvidia-open-dkms nvidia-open-lts nvidia-utils lib32-nvidia-utils (installed ones only)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm linux-headers linux-lts-headers
    $ build from the AUR as your user, then pacman -U: nvidia-580xx-utils lib32-nvidia-580xx-utils nvidia-580xx-dkms

[6/12] Hardware video decoding on NVIDIA  (gpu.nvidia-vaapi)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm libva-nvidia-driver

[7/12] paru AUR helper  (arch.paru)
    $ build from the AUR as your user, then pacman -U: paru-bin
    $ edit /etc/paru.conf: enable BottomUp in [options]

[8/12] Flatpak with Flathub  (flatpak.flathub)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm flatpak
    $ flatpak remote-add --if-not-exists --system flathub https://dl.flathub.org/repo/flathub.flatpakrepo

[9/12] Media codecs and thumbnails  (media.codecs)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm gst-libav gst-plugins-base gst-plugins-good gst-plugins-bad gst-plugins-ugly gst-plugin-va ffmpegthumbnailer

[10/12] Video player: Celluloid + mpv  (media.player)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm celluloid mpv

[11/12] Archive tools  (tools.archive)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm tar gzip zip unzip 7zip unrar

[12/12] Firefox  (apps.firefox)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm firefox

A reboot is required afterwards.
